* @title BREAK replacement cycle example
* @attribution Griswold 1971, Chapter 4
* @expect >>>
* RED
* ORANGE,YELLOW,GREEN,BLUE,INDIGO,VIOLET,RED,
* <<<
 RB = 'RED,ORANGE,YELLOW,GREEN,BLUE,INDIGO,VIOLET,'
 CYCLE = BREAK(',') . ITEM LEN(1) REM . REST
 RB CYCLE = REST ITEM ','
 OUTPUT = ITEM
 OUTPUT = RB
END
